# GSD (Get Ship Done) — Command Reference for Clause_Radar

GSD is a meta-prompting and spec-driven development system for AI coding agents. Commands are invoked **inside your AI agent** as slash commands (e.g., `/gsd:plan-phase 1`), NOT as shell/PowerShell commands.

