## 4. Quality, Review & Audit

| Command | When to use it |
|---------|---------------|
| `/gsd:code-review <N>` | **Reviewing source files** changed during a phase for bugs, security, and code quality. Produces `<N>-REVIEW.md`. Depth: `--depth=quick|standard|deep`. Use after execute-phase. |
| `/gsd:review <N>` | **Cross-AI peer review** of phase plans from external AI CLIs (Gemini, Claude, Codex, OpenCode, Qwen, Cursor). Produces REVIEWS.md. Use after plan-phase to get external validation before execution. |
| `/gsd:review-backlog` | **Reviewing 999.x backlog items** and optionally promoting them to active milestone or removing stale entries. Use periodically to keep backlog healthy. |
| `/gsd:audit-uat` | **Cross-phase audit** of all outstanding UAT and verification items. Scans all phases for pending/skipped/blocked items. Use at milestone boundaries. |
| `/gsd:audit-milestone <version>` | **Verifying milestone completion** against original intent. Checks requirements coverage, cross-phase integration, E2E flows. Run BEFORE completing a milestone. |
| `/gsd:audit-fix` | **Autonomous audit-to-fix pipeline.** Runs audit, classifies findings as auto-fixable vs manual, fixes auto-fixable with test verification. Use after audit-uat finds issues. |
| `/gsd:secure-phase <N>` | **Retroactive security review** of a completed phase. Verifies threat mitigations. Produces SECURITY.md. Use for phases handling sensitive data (Clause_Radar: PDF upload, API keys). |
| `/gsd:eval-review <N>` | **Auditing AI phase evaluation coverage.** Checks whether eval strategy from AI-SPEC.md was implemented. Produces EVAL-REVIEW.md with score, verdict, gaps, remediation. |
| `/gsd:ui-phase <N>` | **Generating UI design contract** (UI-SPEC.md) for frontend phases. Orchestrates UI researcher + checker. Use for any UI-heavy phase. |
| `/gsd:ui-review <N>` | **Retroactive 6-pillar visual audit** of implemented frontend. Produces UI-REVIEW.md with graded assessment. |

